# RingLight boot service is DISABLED on fresh flashes (user round 135+2:
# fresh flash = no light at boot). The GUI arms it through the pkexec
# helper (polkit action org.meizu20.tools.led-control, password EVERY
# time — round 136: both arm and Lights off must confirm). The mode file
# /var/lib/ringlight/mode (tmpfiles seed: "off") holds the armed effect.
disable ringlight-boot.service
